ISO-10303-21;
/* U051: SHAPE_REPRESENTATION.context_of_items = $ (null), directly governing a live shell */
/* DEFECT: PrepareUnits's rep->ContextOfItems().IsNull() branch fires -- */
/* 'Bad RepresentationContext, default unit taken' -- reader silently defaults units */
/* and still returns a live, non-null shape (not a GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET type-skip like M063) */
/* Byte assertion: literal form SHAPE_REPRESENTATION('no_context_shape',(#N),$) */
